   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Brighter, full natural color for Journey Church photos shot in ProRAW at -1.0 exposure. Apply first, then crop and set white balance. Whites reach true white; blacks lifted only slightly.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </crs:Description>
